OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FScattered
OL,6,Frain showers will continue to feed
OL,7,Finto western Scotland and northwest
OL,8,FEngland and Wales, turning to snow on
OL,9,FScottish mountains. A very cold night
OL,10,Ffor central and southern areas with a
OL,11,Fwidespread frost, severe for some, and
OL,12,Fisolated fog.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FSunshine for England, and
OL,15,Fsunny intervals for Wales. Rain and
OL,16,Fshowers for northern Scotland and its
OL,17,Fborder. Increasingly strong winds for
OL,18,Fexposed Irish Sea coasts and northern
OL,19,Fhills. Feeling cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
